<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99834" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύνεδρ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕδρα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sitting with in council</i>, of persons, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.34
			</span></i>, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				192
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ . . συνέδρου καὶ
				τυραννικοῦ κύκλου,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ κύκλου τῶν συνεδρευόντων
					τυράννων</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				749
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of birds,
				<i>sitting together, friendly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				608b29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς., ὁ, ἡ</span>, <i>one who
				sits with others, assessor, coadjutor</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δίκη ξ. Ζηνὸς . . νόμοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1382
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύνεδροι</span>
			<i>select commissioners</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.22
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.86
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				273.2
			</span></i> (Milet., <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.686.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; <i>delegates to the assembly</i> of the
			second Athenian league, ib.<i><span class="en">
				43.44
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv B.C.)</span>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				8.29
			</span></i>, Jusj. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.150
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in pl., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουλή</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(9).234.40
			</span></i> (Eretria, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνώμη συνέδρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					213.1
				</span></i>
			 (Didyma, <span class="entity">iv/iii B.C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ
				ς. τῶν νησιωτῶν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				40.1
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>.</div>
